OL,3,GNEWSA'A lot of military wives give up
OL,4,Atheir dreams'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAccording to the Ministry of Defence's
OL,7,Flatest Families Continuous Attitude
OL,8,FSurvey, 52% of spouses say they do not
OL,9,Ffeel valued by the service, compared
OL,10,Fwith 19% who do.
